   "description": "The Aquatique GMT Graphite combines vintage-inspired proportions with modern functionality. Its 37.4mm case and 43.5mm lug-to-lug carry the timeless charm of mid-century tool watches, now enhanced with a true GMT complication. The dark grey sunray dial adds depth and refinement, while polished triangle markers and painted numerals at 3, 9, and 12 maintain clarity and balance. At 6 o’clock, a discreet date window adds practicality without breaking symmetry. With BGW9 Super-LumiNova on the bezel numerals, hands, and applied markers, the Graphite remains highly legible in all conditions. Finished with a two-tone 24-hour sapphire bezel and powered by the reliable Miyota 9075 true GMT movement, the Graphite is a versatile travel companion with understated elegance.",
