   "priceMinor": 49900,
   "currency": "USD",
   "availability": "sold_out",
   "description": "Introducing Aquatique, a 37mm Diver watch – a stunning tribute to the vintage diver watches of the 1960s. At Hult Watch Company, we are passionate about creating reliable, yet affordable vintage-inspired timepieces with automatic movement that pay tribute to the classic diver watches of the past. And with its beautiful sunray dial, reliable automatic movement, and durable 316 stainless steel case, Aquatique is a perfect example of our dedication to craftsmanship and quality. But the real beauty of this watch lies in its attention to detail. The round sapphire bezel, midnight green sunray dial, and metallic hands are all adorned with Super-LumiNova C3, giving the watch the perfect vintage look and making it easy to read the time, even in the darkest places. The round sapphire bezel adds a stylish touch to the watch while also serving a functional purpose, and the painted markers on the sunray dial ensure that the time is visible at a glance. Inspired by the rugged and reliable diver watches of the past, Aquatique is built to withstand the elements. With a 200-meter water resistance rating this watch is ready for anything - whether you're diving into the depths of the ocean or just enjoying a day at the beach. The Jubilee bracelet, made out of 316L stainless steel, adds a touch of elegance to the watch, making it the perfect accessory for both casual and formal occasions. Embrace the vintage style of the 1960s with Aquatique - a timeless piece that combines classic design with modern performance. Whether you wear it as a statement piece or pair it with a casual outfit, this watch is sure to turn heads and make a statement.",
